   <p>On this page you''ll find gym leggings from a range of brands, compared side by side by price, rating, and number of reviews — all linking directly to Amazon, where you can check current stock, sizing details, and customer photos before buying.</p>', '[{"answer": "Look for moisture-wicking fabric, a high waistband that does not roll down during squats, and flat-lock seams to reduce chafing during high-intensity movement.", "question": "What makes leggings good for the gym specifically?"}, {"answer": "They overlap, but gym leggings are usually built with more compression and opacity for high-intensity training, while yoga pants tend to prioritize softness and stretch for low-impact movement.", "question": "Are gym leggings the same as yoga pants?"}]', '2026-06-30 22:31:08.849062+00'),
	('plus-size-leggings', 'Plus Size Leggings', '<p>Plus size leggings deserve the same attention to fit and fabric quality as any other size — not just a bigger version of a standard cut. The options below are chosen for size ranges, fabric opacity, and waistband support, with real customer ratings to help you compare before you buy.</p>
   <p>Browse by price, rating, or how many reviews each style has, and click through to Amazon for the full size chart and current availability.</p>', '[{"answer": "Check the customer reviews and photos on the Amazon listing — opacity depends heavily on fabric thickness, and reviewers often mention this directly, especially for lighter colors.", "question": "How do I know if plus size leggings will be opaque enough?"}, {"answer": "Sizing varies by brand. Check the size chart on each Amazon listing and cross-reference with reviews mentioning fit before ordering.", "question": "Do plus size leggings run true to size?"}]', '2026-06-30 22:31:08.849062+00'),
	('biker-shorts', 'Biker Shorts', '<p>Biker shorts sit at that sweet spot between leggings and regular shorts — full coverage at the waist and thigh, without the heat of a full-length legging. They''re a staple for summer workouts, casual outfits, and everything in between.</p>
   <p>The styles listed here are compared by price, customer rating, and review count, with pocket options and waist height noted where available — all linking straight to Amazon for sizing and current stock.</p>', '[{"answer": "Most fall between 3 and 8 inches inseam, often offered in multiple lengths by the same brand — check the listing title or size options for the exact measurement.", "question": "What length are biker shorts usually?"}, {"answer": "Many do, especially side pockets sized for a phone, but it varies by style — check the product title and images, which usually call this out explicitly.", "question": "Do biker shorts have pockets?"}]', '2026-06-30 22:31:08.849062+00'),
	('high-waisted-leggings', 'High Waisted Leggings', '<p>Discover the best high-waisted leggings for women designed for comfort, support, and style. Explore flattering fits, squat-proof fabrics, and top-rated activewear perfect for workouts, yoga, and everyday wear.</p>', '[{"answer": "High-waisted leggings sit above the natural waist, usually between the navel and ribcage. This gives extra core coverage, helps keep the waistband in place during movement, and creates a smoother, more supportive fit compared to mid-rise or low-rise styles.", "question": "What makes high-waisted leggings different from regular leggings?"}, {"answer": "Yes — the higher waistband stays put during squats, lunges, and other high-intensity movements without rolling down. Look for styles with four-way stretch fabric and moisture-wicking properties for the best workout performance.", "question": "Are high-waisted leggings good for working out?"}, {"answer": "Check customer reviews and photos on the product listing — reviewers almost always mention opacity during movement. Darker colours and thicker fabrics tend to perform better, but real-world feedback from verified buyers is the most reliable indicator.", "question": "How do I know if high-waisted leggings will be squat-proof?"}, {"answer": "Absolutely. Many women wear high-waisted leggings as everyday bottoms paired with oversized tops, blazers, or tunics. Styles in solid colours or subtle textures tend to transition most easily from gym to daily wear.", "question": "Can high-waisted leggings be worn casually, not just for exercise?"}, {"answer": "Sizing varies by brand, so always check the size chart on the product listing before ordering. If you are between sizes, reviews mentioning fit and stretch can help — many brands note whether their leggings run true to size, small, or large.", "question": "What size should I choose for high-waisted leggings?"}, {"answer": "Yes — many brands offer high-waisted leggings in extended sizes specifically designed for a comfortable, secure fit at every size. The high waistband is particularly flattering for plus-size body types, offering extra support without digging in. Always check the size range listed on the product page before buying.", "question": "Are high-waisted leggings suitable for plus-size women?"}]', '2026-07-01 00:45:46.588794+00');


